{"id": "EUVD-2026-97489", "enisaUuid": "be6fe912-6d5b-37bb-9774-0f48c53df0b1", "description": "Square Squash through commit e73f280 contains an insecure deserialization vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to store crafted YAML via the POST /api/1.0/symbolication endpoint. When occurrences referencing the attacker-controlled symbolication UUID are symbolicated, the stored values are passed to YAML.load with SafeYAML in unsafe mode, enabling arbitrary Ruby object deserialization and potential code execution.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T15:16:39", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:57:23", "baseScore": 9.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/HJ87QX5ifg", "https://github.com/SquareSquash/web/blob/e73f2805f9eb30780a5c213b001f0f4255660fbf/app/controllers/api/v1_controller.rb", "https://github.com/SquareSquash/web/blob/e73f2805f9eb30780a5c213b001f0f4255660fbf/config/preinitializers/safe_yaml.rb", "https://github.com/SquareSquash/web/blob/e73f2805f9eb30780a5c213b001f0f4255660fbf/lib/workers/symbolication_creator.rb", "https://github.com/SquareSquash/web/blob/e73f2805f9eb30780a5c213b001f0f4255660fbf/app/models/symbolication.rb", "https://github.com/SquareSquash/web", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/square-squash-through-commit-e73f280-unauthenticated-yaml-deserialization-via-symbolication-api"], "aliases": ["GHSA-f7j3-hchq-qp35", "CVE-2026-109391"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.48, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "669b46f3-5799-3925-8cf0-bfa35523443c", "product": {"name": "Squash", "vendor": {"name": "square"}}, "product_version": "0 \u2264e73f2805f9eb30780a5c213b001f0f4255660fbf"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "524a016e-740d-3c8d-ba6d-303e51677e13", "vendor": {"name": "square"}}], "isExploited": false}